  "root_cause_2026_09_09": "The feature_store step is optional=True and declares reports/feature_store_summary.json instead of the parquet it writes. When it did not run, nothing failed, data_freshness had no reason to look at the snapshot, and full_universe_shadow.compute() called list_snapshots()[-1] - which returned 2026-07-21. Every downstream guard then correctly reported that its own derived artifact was fresh."
